g but i didn't um  is this source genuine from everything i  can see it seems to be does it make  sense that amazon would want this  project to return does it make sense  that amazon would see stargate really as  a sleeping giant of sci-fi something  that they can really exploit and that  may potentially make a couple of movies  and a couple of tv series out of  something that they can grow into a  franchise similar to that of star trek  do you guys think  please leave a comment let me know and  if you are new to the channel please  like subscribe and hit that bell  notification and i will be keeping a  really close eye on this story and if  anything changes i will get it out to  you straight away  right thanks guys and i'll see you next  time  [Music]

